The affected closed position is omitted.

========== API ==========

unrealizedGains({ accounts: ['Assets:Broker'] })

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
commodity STOCK
  format 1,000 STOCK
account Assets:Broker
account Assets:Other
account Assets:Cash
account Income:Gains
P 2024-01-01 STOCK 30 SEK
P 2024-01-01 USD 2 SEK

2024-01-01 Purchase
  Assets:Broker  2 STOCK {20 SEK}
  Assets:Other  1 STOCK {20 SEK}
  Assets:Cash  -60 SEK

2024-02-01 Disposal with foreign basis
  Assets:Broker  -1 STOCK {10 USD} @ 15 USD
  Assets:Cash

2024-03-01 Close position
  Assets:Broker  -1 STOCK {20 SEK} @ 30 SEK
  Assets:Cash  30 SEK
  Income:Gains  -10 SEK

